Part A -Task A1

A1. Proposed screen sequence
1. Volunteers should be able to browse available community events before deciding which event to join.
2. VOlunteers should be able to register for a selected community event by submitting their registration details.

A2. Business that is still unknown 

It has not yet confirmed whether a volunteer's registration is automatically accpted after submission whether the Event Organiser or Volunteer Coordinator must review and approve it.

B - Plan User Journey

| Screen | Proposed title | Purpose and case evidence |
|---|---|---|
| Browse Community Events | Display available events for volunteers to explore | Browse events |
| Event Details | Display event name, date, time, location and desciption | View event details |
| Volunteer Registration | Allow volunteers to enter their registration information | Register for event |
| Missing Information | Show feedback when required information are missing | Candidate validation rule |
| Registration Submitted | Acknowledge that the registration has been submitted | Submit registration |

